### API de Levels - Pruebas de endpoints

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7014/api
@accessToken = {{auth_response.response.body.token}}

### 1. Obtener todos los niveles
GET {{baseUrl}}/Levels
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Obtener un nivel por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Levels/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Crear un nuevo nivel
POST {{baseUrl}}/Levels
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Nivel Principiante",
    "description": "Nivel básico para nuevos participantes",
    "tutorId": 1
}

### 4. Actualizar un nivel
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Levels/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Nivel Principiante Actualizado",
    "description": "Descripción actualizada del nivel básico",
    "tutorId": 2
}

### 5. Asignar tutor a un nivel
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Levels/1/assign-tutor
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tutorId": 3
}

### 6. Obtener participantes de un nivel
GET {{baseUrl}}/Levels/1/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Asignar participante a un nivel
POST {{baseUrl}}/Levels/1/participants/2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Remover participante de un nivel
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Levels/1/participants/2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Obtener niveles de un tutor específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/Levels/by-tutor/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Eliminar un nivel (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Levels/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# Nota: Para usar estos endpoints, primero debes autenticarte usando el endpoint de Auth
# y obtener el token para reemplazar {{accessToken}}